---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Page
	title="Contact Handy – Report a Problem or Suggest a Tool"
	description="Contact Handy to report a problem, ask a question or suggest a new tool."
	heading="Contact us"
>
	<p>We would like to hear from you, whether something is broken or you have an idea for a new tool.</p>

	<p>
		Email us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>Reporting a problem</h2>
	<p>It helps us fix things faster if you tell us:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>which tool you were using,</li>
		<li>what you expected and what happened instead,</li>
		<li>your phone or computer and browser (for example "Tecno phone, Chrome").</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
		<strong>Please do not send us your private documents or photos.</strong> Handy never needs them. A description or a
		screenshot of the problem is enough.
	</p>

	<h2>Suggest a tool</h2>
	<p>Tell us what you wish existed and why. Ideas from real everyday needs go to the top of our list.</p>

	<p class="muted">We read every message and reply as soon as we can. We may not be able to answer every request.</p>
</Page>
